  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently the fedora:TimeMap RDF type is present as part of the TimeMap's RDF.  It should use a memento standard triple instead.  The task of this ticket is to add the memento:TimeMap rdf type to the RDF alongside the old fedora:Timemap (to preserve backwards compatibility).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
